	(text "MODULE TS DIODES - PROVISION ONLY IN REV A (DECISIONS.md D022):\n\"Verified: the FS02MR12A8MA2B gives the TS pins no isolation rating (the module's 4.2 kV 'basic' figure is terminal-to-heatsink only), and the only\ndocumented readout anywhere in Infineon's material is the HV-side delta-sigma ADC inside the 1EDI3035AS driver (zero distribution stock),\nreferenced to the switch source and sent across the driver's own barrier. A control-GND op-amp front end has no datasheet basis.\"\nRev A: TS pads routed inside the HV zone, UNPOPULATED - no readout circuitry on this board. Module thermal protection = coldplate NTC\n(conservative threshold) + DESAT fast backstop. Upgrade path: 1EDI3035AS drivers (when stocked) or per-phase isolated amplifiers."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
